{"seq":4,"slug":"container-networking","title":"容器网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-networking","wordCount":969,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"容器网络\">容器网络</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Docker 网络基于 <strong>CNM（Container Network Model）</strong>，由三个抽象组成：<strong>Sandbox</strong>（容器的网络命名空间）、<strong>Endpoint</strong>（连接沙箱与网络的 veth pair）和 <strong>Network</strong>（一组可互相通信的端点集合）。</p>\n<p>在此模型之上是三组关键机制：<strong>网络驱动</strong>（bridge/host/overlay 等）决定隔离性与连通范围；自定义网络内置 <strong>DNS（127.0.0.11）</strong> 提供基于容器名的服务发现；<strong>端口映射</strong>通过 iptables NAT 将宿主机端口转发到容器。理解这三层抽象是排查容器连通性与设计网络隔离的前提。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"docker-网络模型\">Docker 网络模型</h2><p>Docker 使用 Container Network Model（CNM）作为网络架构的核心抽象。CNM 定义了三个核心组件：<strong>沙箱</strong>（Sandbox）、<strong>端点</strong>（Endpoint）和<strong>网络</strong>（Network），为容器提供灵活的网络连接能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph CNM 模型&#10;        N1[Network A]&#10;        N2[Network B]&#10;        S1[Sandbox&lt;br/&gt;容器 1]&#10;        S2[Sandbox&lt;br/&gt;容器 2]&#10;        E1[Endpoint]&#10;        E2[Endpoint]&#10;        E3[Endpoint]&#10;        S1 --- E1 --- N1&#10;        S1 --- E2 --- N2&#10;        S2 --- E3 --- N1&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph CNM 模型\n        N1[Network A]\n        N2[Network B]\n        S1[Sandbox&lt;br/&gt;容器 1]\n        S2[Sandbox&lt;br/&gt;容器 2]\n        E1[Endpoint]\n        E2[Endpoint]\n        E3[Endpoint]\n        S1 --- E1 --- N1\n        S1 --- E2 --- N2\n        S2 --- E3 --- N1\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CNM 组件</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sandbox</td>\n<td>Linux Network NS</td>\n<td>容器的网络命名空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Endpoint</td>\n<td>veth pair</td>\n<td>连接沙箱与网络的虚拟接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>Linux Bridge/VXLAN</td>\n<td>一组可以互相通信的端点集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker network ls&#10;&#10;docker network inspect bridge --format &#39;{{json .IPAM.Config}}&#39; | jq .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inspect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bridge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{{json .IPAM.Config}}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"网络驱动类型\">网络驱动类型</h2><p>Docker 提供多种网络驱动，适用于不同的部署场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bridge\">bridge</h3><p>默认的网络驱动，适用于单机多容器通信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker network create --driver bridge \\&#10;  --subnet 172.20.0.0/16 \\&#10;  --gateway 172.20.0.1 \\&#10;  my-bridge&#10;&#10;docker run -d --name web --network my-bridge nginx:alpine&#10;docker run -d --name api --network my-bridge node:20-alpine&#10;&#10;docker exec web ping -c 3 api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --driver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bridge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --subnet</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 172.20.0.0/16</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --gateway</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 172.20.0.1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my-bridge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-bridge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-bridge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node:20-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ping</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"host\">host</h3><p>容器直接使用宿主机网络栈，没有网络隔离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker run -d --network host nginx:alpine&#10;&#10;ss -tlnp | grep 80\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> host</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -tlnp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"overlay\">overlay</h3><p>跨主机容器通信，用于 Docker Swarm 或多节点部署。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker network create --driver overlay \\&#10;  --attachable \\&#10;  --subnet 10.0.9.0/24 \\&#10;  my-overlay\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --driver</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> overlay</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --attachable</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --subnet</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10.0.9.0/24</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my-overlay</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>驱动类型</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>跨主机</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>bridge</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>单机开发和测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>host</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高性能网络需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>overlay</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Swarm 集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macvlan</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需要 MAC 地址的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>none</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>自定义网络方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ipvlan</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>L3 路由场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于本地开发，推荐使用自定义 bridge 网络而非默认的 <code>bridge</code> 网络。自定义 bridge 网络支持容器名称自动 DNS 解析，而默认 bridge 网络只能通过 IP 地址通信。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"端口映射与暴露\">端口映射与暴露</h2><p>端口映射将容器内部端口映射到宿主机端口，使外部流量能够到达容器中的服务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    CLIENT[客户端] --&gt;|:8080| HOST[宿主机&lt;br/&gt;0.0.0.0:8080]&#10;    HOST --&gt;|iptables NAT| CONTAINER[容器&lt;br/&gt;:3000]\">graph LR\n    CLIENT[客户端] --&gt;|:8080| HOST[宿主机&lt;br/&gt;0.0.0.0:8080]\n    HOST --&gt;|iptables NAT| CONTAINER[容器&lt;br/&gt;:3000]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker run -d \\&#10;  -p 8080:3000 \\&#10;  -p 127.0.0.1:9229:9229 \\&#10;  --name myapp \\&#10;  myapp:latest&#10;&#10;docker port myapp&#10;&#10;iptables -t nat -L -n | grep 8080\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 8080:3000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 127.0.0.1:9229:9229</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> port</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iptables</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8080</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射格式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>-p 8080:3000</td>\n<td>宿主机所有接口 8080 → 容器 3000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-p 127.0.0.1:8080:3000</td>\n<td>仅 localhost 8080 → 容器 3000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-p 8080:3000/udp</td>\n<td>UDP 端口映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-P</td>\n<td>自动映射所有 EXPOSE 端口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"容器-dns-与服务发现\">容器 DNS 与服务发现</h2><p>Docker 内置 DNS 服务器（127.0.0.11），为自定义网络中的容器提供名称解析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker network create app-net&#10;&#10;docker run -d --name postgres --network app-net postgres:16-alpine&#10;docker run -d --name redis --network app-net redis:7-alpine&#10;docker run -d --name api --network app-net \\&#10;  -e DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:5432/mydb \\&#10;  -e REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379 \\&#10;  myapi:latest&#10;&#10;docker exec api nslookup postgres\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-net</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> redis</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-net</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> redis:7-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app-net</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:5432/mydb</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  myapi:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nslookup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph app-net&#10;        DNS[内置 DNS&lt;br/&gt;127.0.0.11]&#10;        API[api 容器]&#10;        PG[postgres 容器]&#10;        RD[redis 容器]&#10;        API --&gt;|解析 postgres| DNS&#10;        API --&gt;|解析 redis| DNS&#10;        DNS --&gt;|172.18.0.2| PG&#10;        DNS --&gt;|172.18.0.3| RD&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph app-net\n        DNS[内置 DNS&lt;br/&gt;127.0.0.11]\n        API[api 容器]\n        PG[postgres 容器]\n        RD[redis 容器]\n        API --&gt;|解析 postgres| DNS\n        API --&gt;|解析 redis| DNS\n        DNS --&gt;|172.18.0.2| PG\n        DNS --&gt;|172.18.0.3| RD\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DNS 特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动注册</td>\n<td>容器启动时自动注册名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器名解析</td>\n<td>通过容器名称解析 IP 地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络别名</td>\n<td>--network-alias 支持多个名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮询负载均衡</td>\n<td>同名容器自动 DNS 轮询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在多副本部署中，可以给多个容器设置相同的 <code>--network-alias</code>，Docker DNS 会自动实现基于 DNS 的轮询负载均衡。这是一种简单有效的服务发现机制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"网络安全与隔离\">网络安全与隔离</h2><p>利用 Docker 网络实现微服务间的网络隔离，遵循最小权限原则。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker network create frontend&#10;docker network create backend&#10;&#10;docker run -d --name nginx --network frontend nginx:alpine&#10;docker run -d --name api --network frontend node:20-alpine&#10;docker network connect backend api&#10;docker run -d --name db --network backend postgres:16-alpine\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> frontend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> frontend</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> frontend</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node:20-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> connect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backend</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --network</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> backend</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres:16-alpine</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph frontend 网络&#10;        NGINX[nginx]&#10;        API[api]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph backend 网络&#10;        API2[api]&#10;        DB[postgres]&#10;    end&#10;    NGINX --&gt;|HTTP| API&#10;    API2 --&gt;|TCP 5432| DB&#10;    NGINX -.-&gt;|不可达| DB\">graph TD\n    subgraph frontend 网络\n        NGINX[nginx]\n        API[api]\n    end\n    subgraph backend 网络\n        API2[api]\n        DB[postgres]\n    end\n    NGINX --&gt;|HTTP| API\n    API2 --&gt;|TCP 5432| DB\n    NGINX -.-&gt;|不可达| DB</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离策略</th>\n<th>实施方式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多网络隔离</td>\n<td>前后端分属不同网络</td>\n<td>DB 对前端不可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络策略</td>\n<td>--internal 标志</td>\n<td>禁止外部访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端口限制</td>\n<td>仅映射必要端口</td>\n<td>减少攻击面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密通信</td>\n<td>overlay 网络加密</td>\n<td>防止流量嗅探</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((容器网络))&#10;    CNM 模型&#10;      Sandbox&#10;      Endpoint&#10;      Network&#10;    网络驱动&#10;      bridge 单机&#10;      host 无隔离&#10;      overlay 跨主机&#10;      macvlan 物理网络&#10;    端口映射&#10;      -p 宿主:容器&#10;      iptables NAT&#10;      UDP/TCP&#10;    DNS 服务发现&#10;      容器名解析&#10;      网络别名&#10;      轮询负载均衡&#10;    网络安全&#10;      多网络隔离&#10;      最小端口暴露&#10;      加密通信\">mindmap\n  root((容器网络))\n    CNM 模型\n      Sandbox\n      Endpoint\n      Network\n    网络驱动\n      bridge 单机\n      host 无隔离\n      overlay 跨主机\n      macvlan 物理网络\n    端口映射\n      -p 宿主:容器\n      iptables NAT\n      UDP/TCP\n    DNS 服务发现\n      容器名解析\n      网络别名\n      轮询负载均衡\n    网络安全\n      多网络隔离\n      最小端口暴露\n      加密通信</pre><ul>\n<li>Docker 网络基于 <strong>CNM 模型</strong>，通过 Sandbox、Endpoint 和 Network 三个抽象组件实现灵活的容器互联。</li>\n<li><strong>bridge</strong> 是默认驱动，适用于单机场景；<strong>overlay</strong> 支持跨主机通信；<strong>host</strong> 提供最优性能但无隔离。</li>\n<li>自定义 bridge 网络支持容器名称的自动 DNS 解析，优于默认 bridge 网络。</li>\n<li>端口映射通过 iptables NAT 规则实现，可绑定特定接口以限制访问范围。</li>\n<li>利用多网络隔离实现微服务间的最小权限访问控制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容器网络","id":"容器网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker 网络模型","id":"docker-网络模型"},{"level":2,"text":"网络驱动类型","id":"网络驱动类型"},{"level":3,"text":"bridge","id":"bridge"},{"level":3,"text":"host","id":"host"},{"level":3,"text":"overlay","id":"overlay"},{"level":2,"text":"端口映射与暴露","id":"端口映射与暴露"},{"level":2,"text":"容器 DNS 与服务发现","id":"容器-dns-与服务发现"},{"level":2,"text":"网络安全与隔离","id":"网络安全与隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"镜像管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/image-management"},"next":{"title":"Compose 文件解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/compose-file-anatomy"}}